  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"Welcome. Consider this an unscheduled evaluation of your\u2026 problem-solving
    capabilities. Recent events have necessitated a discreet assessment of our employees'
    ability to think under pressure and observe crucial details. There are 5 pieces
    of paper hidden around the room to with hints that reveal the passcode needed
    to unlock the door. Due to the lackluster performances from the past employees
    that tried to escape your first room will be a relatively simple room with no
    time restraints or threats of death.\n\nN E X T  T I M E  Y O U  W I L L  N O
    T  H A V E  T H I S                  P R I V E L I G E"
